--image_dir: path to the original dataset image folder
--json_path: the path of the json annotation file in the original dataset COCO format
--output_dir: The path where the segmented subgraphs and their json annotation files are saved
--slice_size: The size of the side length of the sub-graph after slicing (the default is a square after slicing)
--overlap_ratio: Overlap ratio between subgraphs during segmentation
