Remark:

The PP-YOLOE model is trained with mixed precision on 8 GPUs. If the number of GPUs or batch size changes, you need to adjust the learning rate using the formula lr new = lr default * (batch_size new * GPU_number new ) / (batch_size default * GPU_number default ) .
The default learning rate is for eight cards. Since this is a single-card training, the learning rate needs to be divided by eight. The learning rate can be changed with -o LearningRate.base_lr .
